        ${isSeatAllocated ? `&#10003; Your allocated seat is <b>${allocatedSeat}</b>. Present this E-ticket upon boarding.` : '&#9203; Operator is currently reviewing and allocating seats. Once assigned, your seat number will automatically reflect here.'}
